      <p begin="00:51.480" end="00:54.620" ttm:agent="v1">How the fuck you not my bitch and you be on my case?</p>
      <p begin="00:54.620" end="00:57.850" ttm:agent="v1">How the fuck you not in my life and you be in my face?</p>
      <p begin="00:57.850" end="01:01.060" ttm:agent="v1">How the fuck you not around but still be in my way?</p>
